<title>USA: US corn gluten products flat, demand moderate.</title>
<headline>US corn gluten products flat, demand moderate.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten feed and meal values were unchanged Wednesday. Activity was moderate as buyers continued to book supplies before the Good Friday holiday on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
